{"version": 2, "width": 120, "height": 36, "timestamp": 1788647064, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0.007669, "o", "\r\n### t=0 Sealed-Bid Agent Settlement — two agents, two private reserves, one enclave\r\n"]
[2.008721, "o", "\r\n### t=1 The enclave handler: cre.handlerInTee, ONE getSecrets call, overlap maths, salted commitments\r\n\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m sed -n '/^export const sealBids/,/^}/p;/^export const runSealedBid/,/getSecrets/p' sealed-bid-ts/workflow.ts | head -30\r\n"]
[3.212695, "o", "export const sealBids: SealFn = (buyerMax, sellerMin) => {\r\n\tif (buyerMax === null || sellerMin === null) return { result: 'INVALID_INPUT' }\r\n\tif (sellerMin <= buyerMax) return { result: 'SETTLE', clearingPrice: (buyerMax + sellerMin) / 2 }\r\n\treturn { result: 'NO_OVERLAP' }\r\n}\r\nexport const runSealedBid = (\r\n\truntime: TeeRuntime<Config>,\r\n\tseal: SealFn = sealBids,\r\n\twrite: WriteFn = writeSettlement,\r\n): string => {\r\n\tconst config = runtime.config\r\n\r\n\t// ONE getSecrets call for the whole execution (measured runtime limit:\r\n"]
[6.71517, "o", "\r\n### t=2 The security property is a test suite — with deliberately leaky seals as negative controls\r\n\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m cd sealed-bid-ts && bun test 2>&1 | tail -6\r\n"]
[8.394691, "o", "\u001b[0m\u001b[1mbun test \u001b[0m\u001b[2mv1.4.0 (34cbb9a40)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[32m 34 pass\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[2m 0 fail\u001b[0m\r\n 123 expect() calls\r\nRan 34 tests across 1 file. \u001b[0m\u001b[2m[\u001b[1m463.00ms\u001b[0m\u001b[2m]\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.896296, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m cd contracts && forge test 2>&1 | tail -4\r\n"]
[11.441942, "o", "[PASS] test_zeroForwarderRejectedAtDeploy() (gas: 36369)\r\nSuite result: ok. 13 passed; 0 failed; 0 skipped; finished in 23.75ms (26.68ms CPU time)\r\n\r\nRan 1 test suite in 30.50ms (23.75ms CPU time): 13 tests passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped (13 total tests)\r\n"]
[12.943446, "o", "\r\n### t=3 The whole protocol, for real: vet, bracket, seal in the enclave, SETTLE written to Base Sepolia, A pays B\r\n\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m python3 scripts/demo.py --buyer-max 120 --seller-min 90 --broadcast --settle-transfer 2>&1 | grep -v '^bo-value'\r\n"]
[39.352515, "o", "sealed-bid demo · sealedbid-agent-a (buyer) ↔ sealedbid-agent-b (seller) · label demo-1788647078\r\n  evidence        ed25519, attributable · pubkey c151a183da6f5b52… (published: evidence/signing-key.pub)\r\n  vet_a           reputation.lookup $0.01 → HTTP 200 tx=0x5e70ae2214d02c2255219504e80d9283ec4ebcdd401979d3166eb9c59b530e73\r\n  vet_a/prehire   agent.prehire-check $0.25 → HTTP 200 tx=0xbc62380734ec0481e17df15e8cf2d5a1f95044b1afe2d8f3e71c83482b6f7406\r\n  vet_b           reputation.lookup $0.01 → HTTP 200 tx=0xa9e2373ae98654e00379ac0c9765de94d6900cdad9aba2704cf4fcd64479e2aa\r\n  vet_b/prehire   agent.prehire-check $0.25 → HTTP 200 tx=0x37208c28f05112c9e02cf62203fb6919256fb279c065229b3079875339672c51\r\n  bracket_open    agent.trust-badge $0.01 → HTTP 200 tx=0x6d81005c45e4388dabe63b59ffc692ab4167adb2b09bf96d5043d77c971af960\r\n  seal            cre workflow simulate --target=simulation-settings --broadcast …\r\n                  enclave says: 'SETTLE @ 105 (run: simulation) tx: 0x65089bff619d6dee0619115aeaf8ab59460e1b05abde49839354ef84857f1b23'  runId=0x0e2ba736de8dcffc26796a7872ecd422319ff0ba06e66eef688df420ea4da7fe\r\n  settle          receiver 0xA2eB7d6E… holds clearing=105000000 micro (matches) recordedAt=1788647098 count=7\r\n  transfer        A → B 105000000 wei on Base Sepolia, tx=0xe8034add737304b0c5fd371a1e4c7868bba61da62104555fc8f1e69c1bd32917 block=46439408 status=1\r\n  bracket_close   reputation.lookup $0.01 → HTTP 200 tx=0x3986af4b9e6f68f4f7f7758d2452d7e5f40a257770310148a1f882c741503a68\r\n\r\nresult: SETTLE @ 105 (run: simulation) tx: 0x65089bff619d6dee0619115aeaf8ab59460e1b05abde49839354ef84857f1b23   evidence: evidence/demo/0x0e2ba736de8dcffc26796a7872ecd422319ff0ba06e66eef688df420ea4da7fe.json   chain verifies: True\r\nreserves in the evidence file: none (checked)\r\n"]
[41.016131, "o", "\r\n### t=4 Read the receiver back from Base Sepolia — the clearing price and both commitments, nothing else\r\n\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m cast call 0xA2eB7d6EEd6a4d0976cb29B226093E007E720590 'settlementCount()(uint256)' --rpc-url https://sepolia.base.org\r\n"]
[42.399754, "o", "7\r\n"]
[43.903317, "o", "\r\n### t=5 Now the other case: bands that do not overlap\r\n\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m python3 scripts/demo.py --buyer-max 90 --seller-min 120 --broadcast --no-pay\r\n"]
