[56.198745, "o", "\r\n### t=6 NO_OVERLAP carries nothing — not the gap, not which side was higher — and sends no transaction\r\n\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m cast call 0xA2eB7d6EEd6a4d0976cb29B226093E007E720590 'settlementCount()(uint256)' --rpc-url https://sepolia.base.org\r\n"]
[57.699187, "o", "7\r\n"]
[59.204365, "o", "\r\n### t=7 Every payment and every settlement is verifiable on Basescan without trusting us. SETTLE reveals A_max + B_min — stated, not hidden.\r\n"]
